<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Colourbeam</h1>
<p>Sphere: Mind Sphere
Class: Healer (guild level 45)
Mana: 24
</p><p>Usage:
</p>
<pre>cast colourbeam &lt;target&gt;
<a cmd='#'>cast colourbeam</a>   (at whoever you are fighting)
</pre>
<p>The second of the colour spells, stronger than flash: a beam of searing 
colours strikes the target's mind. The better your power and mind sphere, 
the more it hurts. It does about as well against any armour, and a shield 
takes some of it, but can't stop it.
</p><p>Casting it is an attack and starts a fight. It is also found on staffs, 
wands and scrolls.
</p><p><br />
See Also:
</p>
